Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:00:11 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat(tree): measure a node's min-content and max-content
 widths

`TaffyTree::intrinsic_widths_with_measure` returns each given node's border-box width under
min-content and under max-content available space, through the same measure function as
layout. A host that reports a box's content widths to its page (to choose between a stacked
and a side-by-side presentation, say) can read them after layout without a second tree.
